config BMP180_DEVICE_TEST_MODE
	bool "Enable E2E test mode with mocked temperature output"
	default n
	help
	  When enabled, the BMP180 driver will return a sequence of mocked
	  temperature values instead of reading from the physical sensor via I2C.
